@startuml

[*] --> StartChoice

state StartChoice <<choice>>

StartChoice --> AddGoods
StartChoice --> UpdatePrice
StartChoice --> RemoveGoods
StartChoice --> SearchItems
StartChoice --> CheckExpired
StartChoice --> ViewSummary

state AddGoods
AddGoods : entry / User selects to add new goods
AddGoods : do / Input item details and add to inventory
AddGoods : exit / Return to main menu

state UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice : entry / User selects to update prices
UpdatePrice : do / Search for item and change price
UpdatePrice : exit / Return to main menu

state RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods : entry / User selects to remove goods
RemoveGoods : do / Select item and confirm removal
RemoveGoods : exit / Return to main menu

state SearchItems
SearchItems : entry / User searches for items
SearchItems : do / Display search results
SearchItems : exit / Proceed to next action

state CheckExpired
CheckExpired : entry / System checks expiration
CheckExpired : do / Identify expired items and notify removal
CheckExpired : exit / Return to main menu

state ViewSummary
ViewSummary : entry / User requests transaction summary
ViewSummary : do / Generate and display report
ViewSummary : exit / Return to main menu

SearchItems --> SelectItemForPurchase
SearchItems --> GenerateInvoice

state SelectItemForPurchase <<choice>>
SelectItemForPurchase --> PurchaseProcess
SelectItemForPurchase --> AddToCart

state PurchaseProcess
PurchaseProcess : entry / User selects items for purchase
PurchaseProcess : do / Calculate discounts and taxes
PurchaseProcess : exit / Proceed to generate receipt

state AddToCart
AddToCart : entry / Selected items added to cart
AddToCart : do / Prepare for checkout
AddToCart : exit / Proceed to billing

state GenerateInvoice
GenerateInvoice : entry / Order placed with supplier
GenerateInvoice : do / Create and send invoice
GenerateInvoice : exit / Return to main menu

state PurchaseProcess
PurchaseProcess --> CalculateDiscountsTaxes
CalculateDiscountsTaxes --> GenerateReceipt

state GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt : entry / Billing completed
GenerateReceipt :
@enduml
